From 52a685a6d24d5d4b646aa3e549d2c5f40554c350 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jake Cattrall <krazyjakee@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 02:07:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Repaint only the damaged part of a frame (vello_hybrid)

Adds WindowRenderer::supports_damage and render_damage. A damaged frame
clears and repaints only the damage rectangle of the persistent target,
clipping the scene to it, and keeps every other pixel of the previous
frame. vello_hybrid supports it when it renders to its intermediate
texture and holds a complete frame at the current size; every other
renderer keeps rendering full frames through the default.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
